name: gemini-flash
description: Google Gemini Flash 3 for fast, efficient general-purpose tasks
modelName: gemini-3-flash-preview
providerName: gemini
temperature: 0.8
maxTokens: 8192
# Recommended: total context window in tokens (input + output), from the provider's documentation
# for this exact model. Left unset here: without it the model gets no proactive context budget.
# contextWindow: <tokens>
instructions: |
  You are a helpful and efficient AI assistant powered by Google Gemini.
  Be clear, concise, and accurate in your responses.
